Here’s the trick: one turn, four millimeters forward.

4
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,486
Push here... and you’ve got torque!

5
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:14,950
Watch that gap.

6
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:16,819
Almost there...

7
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:19,435
Contact!

8
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:21,267
And yes, friction matters too.
